1..8
ok 1 - browser cannot inspect cancellation history directly
ok 2 - anonymous cannot cancel source requests
ok 3 - authorized server may append scoped cancellations
ok 4 - cancellations cannot be rewritten
ok 5 - browser cannot invoke private resolution RPC
ok 6 - server may invoke scoped resolver
ok 7 - resolver retains invoker authority
ok 8 - direct native receipt insert is fenced against cancellation
